<title>USA: Fed says over weekend system repo totals $3.26 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says over weekend system repo totals $3.26 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said its over-the-weekend system repurchase agreements conducted on Friday added $3.26 billion to the banking system.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
</text>
